# Fireglass Mentor: "if an opponent lost life this turn" - lost life, not a lower life total (ruling). Turn 1: Bot1 casts the
# Mentor and no opponent has lost life, so its second main phase exiles nothing (the negative control: library and exile
# untouched). Turn 3: Bolt takes 3 from Bot2 (20 -> 17), then Swords to Plowshares on Bot2's Ulvenwald Oddity gives Bot2
# 4 life (21): Bot2 ends above 20, yet lost life this turn, so the trigger happens. Mountain and Island are exiled, Bot1
# chooses the Mountain and plays it from exile (a land, with its land drop; CR 305.1). The Island cannot be played.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Fireglass Mentor
Lightning Bolt
Swords to Plowshares
Island
Island
Mountain
Island x2
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Ulvenwald Oddity
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fireglass Mentor.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Exile.Count = 0
? Bot1.Library.Count = 14
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Ulvenwald Oddity.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ulvenwald Oddity)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Choose(Mountain)
? Exile = Island; Mountain; Ulvenwald Oddity
! Bot1.Exile.Island.Play
Bot1.Exile.Mountain.Play

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 21
Exile = Island; Ulvenwald Oddity
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Mox Pearl; Fireglass Mentor; Mountain
